    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick your breed and build your clan. An open-world adventure about a pup from the Scottish highlands destined to the lead a rebellion against the evil Cat King Of England.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the beautiful open world of the Paw Isles, rescuing and gaining control of a variety of different dog breeds, from the Schnauzers in Shnuazerland, to the Pugs in Pugton. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your weapons and armor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bark to convince rogue dogs to join your rebellion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Name and upgrade your clan of pups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gain new abilities to traverse a gorgeous open world reminiscent of Wind Waker and Breath of the Wild.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Listen to beautiful Scottish music as you lead your pack of pups.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick your breed and build your clan. An open-world adventure about a pup from the Scottish highlands destined to the lead a rebellion against the evil Cat King Of England.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the beautiful open world of the Paw Isles, rescuing and gaining control of a variety of different dog breeds, from the Schnauzers in Shnuazerland, to the Pugs in Pugton. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your weapons and armor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bark to convince rogue dogs to join your rebellion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Name and upgrade your clan of pups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gain new abilities to traverse a gorgeous open world reminiscent of Wind Waker and Breath of the Wild.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Listen to beautiful Scottish music as you lead your pack of pups.</p>",
